# Project rules: Next.js SaaS MVP

- Use the App Router (the app/ directory). Don't mix in the old pages/ router unless I ask.
- Never build our own password storage or session system. Use the auth provider we chose.
- Only variables prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ may be used in client components. Everything else stays server-side.
- Payments use Stripe Checkout or Stripe-hosted pages. Prices come from the server, never from the client.
- Run npm run build before saying a task is done.
- Keep v1 to the core loop: sign up, do the one main thing, pay. Ask before adding settings pages, teams, or admin panels.
